  Widow Theresa is a harsh, sour-faced woman, with suspicious eyes and a
  mannish, angular jaw that she thrusts out when she is angry, which is nearly
  always. You gather that she was very poor before coming to Maiden House, and
  she harbors a bitter dislike for anyone whom she perceives as unjustly
  privileged. For reasons that persistently escape you, that includes you.
  Staying out of her way is generally the best tactic.

