  advice. The strange thing is, her advice always seems to make good sense,
  though sometimes you are loathe to admit it. She likes you and occasionally
  does you a good turn when you're in trouble with Widow Theresa.

  on every turn while Widow Fiona is here and one chance in 5 and before gallows
